{"title": "God Books Table", "pageid": 19026, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/God_Books_Table", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Book drop tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>God Books Table</b>, also known as <code>GEN_Book_Gods</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GEN_Book_Gods+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GEN_Book_Gods+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> is a non-leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> consisting of general <a href=\"/wiki/Books\" title=\"Books\">Books</a> on the topic of <a href=\"/wiki/Deities\" title=\"Deities\">deities</a>. All entries in the table have weight 1. Each entry has a 1/35 chance of being selected.\n</p><p>Some of the books in this table might not exist in the game. If a non-extant item is rolled it is ignored and another roll is made.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drop_Table\">Drop Table</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n  <tbody><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><th>Quantity</th><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr>\n  <tr style=\"text-align:center\"><th>Chance</th>  <td>9/10</td><td>1/10</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5p